{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t you want to be a thrift shop owner and own all sorts of items from a skull to D20 dice? With <strong>Everything Store</strong> you can do that! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your shop</strong>, buy items from sellers or just get them for free by <strong>dumpster diving</strong>! Then pair your items, polish them, or just sell them for a quick profit. Be aware! You will have a <strong>limited space</strong> in your shop but don\u2019t worry you can <strong>upgrade</strong> your shop and storage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Pace:</strong> The game is designed to be not stressful for you! You can just chill and enjoy managing your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Customize Your Shop:</strong> You can customize &amp; upgrade your shop with bigger &amp; better furnishers for more storage space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy Your Customers:</strong> In Everything Store you need to find the best item for your customers and satisfy them. Remember, customer is always right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Best Items:</strong> Carefully search for the best items to put into your store! Find the best fitting items for your storage grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance your own items:</strong> You can pair your items to make great combinations! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975960?t=1759421997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975960?t=1759421997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975960/b6db693a67735306d6fe43e4630a4172760dd32d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759421997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975960/b6db693a67735306d6fe43e4630a4172760dd32d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759421997","cate